{"id":18668465496072,"type":"artist","name":"Neko Case","artist":null,"year":1970,"weight":12,"info":{"tags":["Alt-country","singer-songwriter","female vocalists","folk","indie"],"country":"US","begin":"1970-09-08","kind":"Person","similar":["Neko Case and Her Boyfriends","Jenny Lewis","Kathleen Edwards","Jenny Lewis with The Watson Twins","case/lang/veirs","Gillian Welch","Amanda Shires","Rilo Kiley","Jeff Tweedy","Lucinda Williams"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Neko_Case_-_Forecastle_Fest_2012_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500","bio":"Neko Case (nacida el 8 de septiembre de 1970 en Alexandria, Virginia) es una cantautora estadounidense, más conocida por su carrera en solitario y como miembro de The New Pornographers.\n\nSu música se etiqueta comúnmente como country alternativo, aunque Case no la describe de esa forma. Ella grabó y giró algunos años como Neko Case & Her Boyfriends antes de cambiar a su propio nombre. Case principalmente escribe su propio material, pero también interpreta y ha grabado versiones de canciones de artistas como Loretta Lynn"},"works":[{"id":194407047993129,"type":"album","name":"Blacklisted","artist":"Neko Case","year":2002,"weight":23,"yt":"Dlg_yXziyLU","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":168227868676293,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 2002","rank":112,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":76687108203,"name":"Scaruffi 2000s","rank":548,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":118798969175346,"name":"RYM Top — Country — Alt-Country","rank":19,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":121946165801189,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Northern American Music","rank":101,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":7567441358720,"type":"album","name":"Fox Confessor Brings the Flood","artist":"Neko Case","year":2006,"weight":13,"yt":"L8VKjJvaDkg","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":71331885159676,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best